<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89919" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπάσχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>experience in addition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				74a
			</span></i>; <i>suffer as well</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μείζω τῶν πρότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					1.156J.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				12.74
			</span></i>; <i>to be further affected</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ ψυχῇ περί τινων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					10.55
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be devoted</i> to <i>addicted to, feel affection for</i>,
			c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.514a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sert.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
				40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ καλῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cic.
					<u>Att.</u>
					2.19.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾧ προσπέπονθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Lib.</u>
					p.6
				</span></i>
			 O.; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ θεῷ] μόνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.16.46
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς κατὰ θάλασσαν ἐργασίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dicaearch.
					1.24
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Macho
				2.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ προσπεπονθός</span>
			<i>that which has an affinity with</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.499e
			</span></i> (s. v.l.).</div>
